				<wikidot:authorName>Cthulwho</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4421513</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>At the start, with the description itself, I was rather skeptical since, in my opinion, it isn't exactly the strongest description in the World. But the incident reports (though I think they shouldn't be named incidents since they aren't really incidents, but instead things the foundation did to prevent incidents) got me, especially the end of the second &quot;incident&quot;. In general I think it's a great SCP deserving of a +1, but you should change the Word incident to maybe addendum or experiment. And the description could be improved a little though it's not necessary. Also praise thy words, cuttlefish of ULTIMATE WISDOOOOM</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
